---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Yinpin | san serif" description="Master Pinyin and you can type any Chinese character you know, no handwriting required. Yinpin drills tone-accurate recall against the full HSK vocabulary, one word at a time.">
	<main class="wrapper">

		<section class="app-hero">

			<div class="video-container">
				<div class="video-glow"></div>
				<div class="media-placeholder hero-placeholder">Hero video — pending</div>
			</div>

			<div class="app-intro">
				<h1>Yinpin</h1>
				<p class="description">
					Every Chinese character you'll ever type starts with Pinyin. Get the sounds and tones right, and your phone does the rest, no handwriting required. Yinpin drills tone-accurate recall against the full HSK vocabulary, one word at a time, until production is second nature.
				</p>

				<a href="https://apps.apple.com/au/app/yinpin-pinyin-dictionary/id6798315086" class="app-store-link">
					<img src="/images/app-store-badge.svg" alt="Download on the App Store" class="badge-svg" />
				</a>
			</div>

		</section>

		<div class="divider"></div>

		<section class="details-grid">

			<div class="detail-card">
				<div class="floating-container">
					<img src="/images/yinpin-typing.png" alt="Yinpin Pinyin typing practice" class="modular-image" />
				</div>
			    <h3>Type Pinyin from Memory</h3>
			    <p>HSK vocabulary cards ask you to produce the romanisation from memory, then reveal the correct spelling with tone marks so you practise the sounds you actually need to recall.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="detail-card">
				<div class="floating-container">
					<img src="/images/yinpin-analyse.png" alt="Yinpin Chinese sentence analysis" class="modular-image" />
				</div>
				<h3>Learn Every Word in Context</h3>
				<p>Every card pairs its word with an example sentence and breakdown, connecting Pinyin to real Chinese usage instead of leaving pronunciation isolated.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="detail-card">
				<div class="floating-container">
					<img src="/images/yinpin-dict.png" alt="Yinpin Chinese dictionary lookup" class="modular-image" />
				</div>
				<h3>Your Dictionary, Everywhere</h3>
				<p>Look up characters and words instantly, then keep your learning progress in sync across iPhone, iPad, and Mac with iCloud.</p>
			</div>

		</section>

	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.wrapper {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 20px;
	}

	h1, p {
		margin-block: 0;
	}

	.app-hero {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
		padding-top: 30px;
		gap: 24px;
		isolation: isolate;
	}

	.video-container {
		position: relative;
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 480px;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-top: 0;
		transform: translateY(-10px);
		transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease;
		background: transparent !important;
	}

	.video-container:hover {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateY(-12px);
	}

	.video-glow {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
		width: 100%;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.media-placeholder {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border: 1px dashed rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
		border-radius: 20px;
		background: #fafafa;
		color: #bbb;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.hero-placeholder {
		aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
		max-height: 520px;
	}

	.app-intro {
		z-index: 2;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 3.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
		color: #111;
	}

	.description {
		max-width: 580px;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		color: #555;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin-bottom: 30px;
	}

	.app-store-link {
		display: inline-block;
		transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
	}

	.app-store-link:hover { transform: scale(1.04) translateY(-4px); }

	.badge-svg {
		height: 52px;
		width: auto;
		display: block;
		filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08));
	}

	.divider {
		height: 1px;
		background: #ffffff;
		margin: 30px 0;
	}

	.details-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 60px;
		margin-bottom: 120px;
	}

	.detail-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.floating-container {
		width: 100%;
		height: 300px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		margin-bottom: 2px;
	}

	.modular-image {
		width: 200px;
		height: 300px;
		object-fit: contain;
		border-radius: 20px;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.12), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
		transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1);
	}

	.detail-card:hover .modular-image {
		transform: scale(1.05) translateY(-10px);
	}

	.detail-card:first-child .modular-image {
		width: auto;
	}

	h3 {
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		color: #111;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.detail-card p {
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: #555;
		line-height: 1.7;
		max-width: 260px;
		margin: 0;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.details-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 40px;
		}
		h1 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
	}
</style>
